LOCATION:Bertolini Quad - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Welcome Day 2026 - Santa Rosa Campus
DESCRIPTION:We're planning lots of fun!Take care of last-minute business 
  Meet other students\, SRJC staff\, faculty\, administrators and our SRJC
  President  Meet our school mascot\, Rosco!  Play lawn games and visit th
 e Resource Fair tables to meet people and get information on important st
 udent resources  FREE Parking  FREE Food  FREE Haircuts  Face Painting  P
 rize Wheel  SRJC Bookstore Scholarship Awards: drawings available for stu
 dents who participate in SRJC Welcome Day events!    &#160\;RSVP HERE! (h
